{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2016-01", "window": 1, "start_date": 1451606400, "end_date": 1452211199, "month_true_total": 512, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:10:59 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "20379916", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993774120", "personaname": "BenRegen", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197993774120/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 19, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 19, "last_played": 1452190143, "avatar": "1c89f097aab7e71ab6a06e9d4c2e281de6d82c12"}, "language": "english", "review": "Can't join with friends. Look for info and find out it's a nightmare to get it to run multiplayer. \n\nSuper angry that this developer is allowed to say this game has multiplayer compatibility when it doesn't work.\n\nImagine if you wanted to see the latest movie at the theatre, but after paying for it the audience had to build the projector before they could watch the movie.\n\nThat's what you've done to us. That's the level of respect you have for your customers. You don't deserve a review.\n", "timestamp_created": 1452190922, "timestamp_updated": 1452190922, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.464455842971801758", "comment_count": 3, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "20377727", "author": {"steamid": "76561198071165764", "personaname": "amosh ༼ つ ◕_◕ ༽つ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/amos97/", "num_games_owned": 394, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 2390, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1586, "last_played": 1558728661, "avatar": "3bd48fe2df918e476d78adf6f9692c22b27d8e8d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Have you ever played this game so hard that it crashed? Well I have.\n\n\n___________________________________________\n############################################################################################\nFATAL ERROR in\naction number 1\nof Draw Event\nfor object oEfBlaster:\n\nFatal Error: Can not create vertex buffer of size 65536 bytes\n10603 vertex buffers allocated with total size of 737280 KB\nat gml_Object_oEfBlaster_Draw_0\n############################################################################################", "timestamp_created": 1452184719, "timestamp_updated": 1503925742, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "20377695", "author": {"steamid": "76561198180694959", "personaname": "The Microwave", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TheMicrowaves/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 5326, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1609, "last_played": 1650380907, "avatar": "aa823f5ffa7555ba973210cae56137c2cf779404"}, "language": "english", "review": "Ok, lets get this straight... it is a wonderful game, amazing (retro) looking graphics, the artifact thing is an amazing concept and... the death messeges and lvl difficulty names are hilarious.\n\n\nGET THIS GAME!", "timestamp_created": 1452184605, "timestamp_updated": 1452184605, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "20376311", "author": {"steamid": "7656119826445832